{"version":1,"content":"<p>將藥物、半導體材料和高性能晶體放到太空中製造，再通過可重複使用的航天器將成品運回地球，這聽起來像是科幻電影中的場景，但歐洲航天企業Space Cargo Unlimited（SCU）正在將這一設想變成現實。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587340.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:43:49.695936+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:31:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:11.512042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:11.512042+00:00","content_hash":"f25a38f4f6f1651da549f1a392c5e0d0e3dd0313633102dac1fad12b9f280af1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}